#: configs/input.py:516
msgid "**True** if the radio button should be disabled."
msgstr "**True**, wenn der Radio-Button deaktiviert sein soll."

#: configs/input.py:521
msgid ""
"Explanation why the radio button is disabled, shown as tooltip when "
